[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2833578905","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105833#issuecomment-2833578905","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105833","id":2833578905,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6o5PuZ","user":{"login":"marcosc90","id":8364242,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNjQyNDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8364242?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90","html_url":"https://github.com/marcosc90","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-27T18:17:30Z","updated_at":"2025-04-27T18:24:29Z","body":"Just did some testing on a bigger project, on [TPS Demo](https://github.com/godotengine/tps-demo) loading screen:\r\n\r\n**Before**\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e6eaf50d-c8ab-4508-8996-6f33288e17a4)\r\n\r\n**After**\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/306e77ce-8971-460d-9d9c-eb67e5e7e2e1)\r\n\r\nI failed to account for `UTF8ArrayToString` execution time, so performance improvement is much better than I first thought, **167ms** to **24ms**, 9ms of `UTF8ArrayToString` are still present, so 100ms were just from shaders","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2833578905/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880536968","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105833#issuecomment-2880536968","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105833","id":2880536968,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rsYGI","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T14:49:50Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T14:49:50Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880536968/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880719896","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105833#issuecomment-2880719896","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105833","id":2880719896,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rtEwY","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T15:43:43Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T15:57:33Z","body":"Sorry for the late (and after the merge) reply.\r\n\r\nI'm worried about [monkey-patching](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monkey_patch) emscripten. It requires us to be alert on any changes ~~of the API~~ of the internals of the API. See the implementation of `GL.getSource()`: https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten/blob/1cb178b2b8d30a0c8860921322c633ca8ee35bd0/src/lib/libwebgl.js#L513-L537\r\n\r\nWhat happens if emscripten actually changes the implementation? How do we handle compiling for multiple versions of emscripten (where versions would have different implementations of the same function)?\r\n\r\nI really think this PR should be reverted and that it is instead proposed [upstream](https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten).\r\n\r\nAnd if someone wants to change this, they can! But that they maintain that change on their own fork of the engine.\r\n\r\n**TL;DR** I'm not against the current code, but I'm anxious about maintaining it. I think we should revert the PR.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880719896/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880763838","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105833#issuecomment-2880763838","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105833","id":2880763838,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rtPe-","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T15:57:03Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T16:01:01Z","body":"I realize that this function is isn't really prone to change, as it is actually just getting a string from memory (it doesn't really do anything more than that). My point still stands though, I really don't like monkey-patching.\r\n\r\n~~We could maybe have a custom function instead, maybe something like `GodotWebGL2.getSourceFast()` that does what this PR does, with a comment that explains why we don't use `GL.getSource()`. That would permit us even to check the emscripten version and return the new implementation instead (if it happens) based on the emscripten version.~~\r\n\r\nEdit: We can't. It's called by emscripten directly.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880763838/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880777717","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105833#issuecomment-2880777717","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105833","id":2880777717,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rtS31","user":{"login":"marcosc90","id":8364242,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNjQyNDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8364242?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90","html_url":"https://github.com/marcosc90","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T16:01:50Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T16:01:50Z","body":"> What happens if emscripten actually changes the implementation? How do we handle compiling for multiple versions of emscripten (where versions would have different implementations of the same function)?\r\n\r\nThe problem with proposing this upstream is that Godot currently doesn't build with the latest Emscripten release. Also I highly doubt that function will change at all, since it is just a very simple method that just get the source code.\r\n\r\nIn any case, I have this patch (and several others) that greatly improve web performance in my own build, so I don’t mind reverting it if necessary. Maintaining it shouldn’t take much effort, and we could even enforce a maximum supported Emscripten version to limit the maintenance burden.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880777717/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880783955","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105833#issuecomment-2880783955","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105833","id":2880783955,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rtUZT","user":{"login":"marcosc90","id":8364242,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNjQyNDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8364242?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90","html_url":"https://github.com/marcosc90","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T16:04:02Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T16:04:02Z","body":"> @marcosc90 I will take your code and implement `GodotWebGL2.getSourceFast()`. Thank you for your PR!\r\n\r\nBut you'll still need to patch Emscripten, since `GL.getSource` is called by `glShaderSource`, so how does that method changes anything?\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten/blob/1cb178b2b8d30a0c8860921322c633ca8ee35bd0/src/lib/libwebgl.js#L3143-L3147\r\n\r\nand `glShaderSource` is more likely to change than `GL.getSource`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880783955/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880785163","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105833#issuecomment-2880785163","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105833","id":2880785163,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rtUsL","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T16:04:28Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T16:04:28Z","body":"> > @marcosc90 I will take your code and implement `GodotWebGL2.getSourceFast()`. Thank you for your PR!\r\n> \r\n> But you'll still need to patch Emscripten, since `GL.getSource` is called by `glShaderSource`, so how does that method changes anything?\r\n> \r\n> https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten/blob/1cb178b2b8d30a0c8860921322c633ca8ee35bd0/src/lib/libwebgl.js#L3143-L3147\r\n> \r\n> and `glShaderSource` is more likely to change than `GL.getSource`\r\n\r\nI deleted my comment, I realized that just afterwards!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880785163/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880863271","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105833#issuecomment-2880863271","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105833","id":2880863271,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rtnwn","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T16:32:29Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T16:32:29Z","body":"Indeed, patching emscripten is quite horrible and asking for trouble.\r\nI think we should explore reverting this, create a custom `godot_glShaderSource` function in `platform/web/js/libs/library_godot_webgl2.js` and add a define in `platform/web/godot_webgl2.h` like we do for `glFramebufferTextureMultiviewOVR` and `glFramebufferTextureMultisampleMultiviewOVR`.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2880863271/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2881240473","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105833#issuecomment-2881240473","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105833","id":2881240473,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rvD2Z","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T19:00:43Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T19:00:43Z","body":"@marcosc90 @Faless I'm on it!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2881240473/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]